              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kaako ba-Juda bakaamba kuti, Myaaka iili makumi one amusanu muumwi ndeyakayakwa ntempele, anu yebo uiyakulule kumazuba otatwe sena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
