              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kaako naakabusigwa kulibasikufwa, basikwiiya bakwe bakayeeya kuti wali kwaamba aya, eno bakazuminina Magwalo, alyalo ijwi ndyaakaamba Jesu.",
          "type": "text",
